flowchart LR
    U[Users] -->|HTTPS| WAF[WAF / API gateway]
    WAF --> APP[Application subnet<br>FM_APP via vault secret]
    APP -->|TLS, private| DB[(Database subnet<br>TDE, Unified Audit)]
    ADM[Administrators] --> PAM[Bastion / PAM<br>just-in-time, recorded]
    PAM -->|named accounts| DB
    DB -->|audit records| SIEM[(SIEM)]
    DB --> KMS[Key management]
    DB -->|masked clone| NP[(Non-production)]
